# Not owned by any patch in this repo. `baseline` is the one filename in this directory exempt
# from the patch-pairing rule, and it is whitelisted by name so a typo like `0004x.checks` cannot
# quietly exempt itself the same way.
#
# tonemap_cuda comes from jellyfin's OWN debian/patches series (0004-add-cuda-tonemap-impl.patch,
# unrelated to this repo's 0004). It is the control: this fork exists to have tonemap_cuda AND
# -tune uhq in one binary, so if the filter vanishes the series stopped applying or the build lost
# CUDA, and the premise is gone whatever the pin patches did.
#
# It is also what keeps at least one assertion running on every platform, so the vacuous-pass
# guard in verify-binary.sh stays meaningful rather than being satisfied by the pin checks alone.

filter  all      tonemap_cuda
